{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AVOID DEADLY PREDATORS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922090/extras/d0985bf0e0734434eb79549b4ad3985f.poster.avif?t=1773489202\" width=1170 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922090/extras/d0985bf0e0734434eb79549b4ad3985f.webm?t=1773489202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922090/extras/d0985bf0e0734434eb79549b4ad3985f.mp4?t=1773489202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life as a bug isn\u2019t easy. Stuck at the bottom of the food chain, it\u2019s <strong>eat or be eaten</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the hundred shoes  of a <strong>centipede</strong> and experience fluid, <strong>procedural animation</strong> that makes every slither, turn, and run feel incredibly responsive and realistic. You're not just driving a bug, <strong>you are the bug!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EAT CRICKETS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922090/extras/9fb22527effb4fd480bd76008c404405.poster.avif?t=1773489202\" width=1170 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922090/extras/9fb22527effb4fd480bd76008c404405.webm?t=1773489202\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922090/extras/9fb22527effb4fd480bd76008c404405.mp4?t=1773489202\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph